@startuml enemy-state-machine

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam arrowColor #cececeff
skinparam arrowFontColor #cececeff
hide empty description

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #202020ff
    BorderColor #808080ff
    FontColor #cececeff
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #404040ff
    BorderColor #808080ff
    FontColor #cececeff
}



[*] --> Patrol : init

Patrol : - walking from a waypoint to another

Patrol -down-> SoundChase : A >= At
note on link
    A = Attraction function
    At = Attraction threshold
end note

CheckSound : - moving toward the last heard sound above threshold

CheckSound -[#4050fbff]-> PlayerChase : <color:#4050fbff>player moving\n<color:#4050fbff> in FOV
CheckSound --> Patrol : check complete

SoundChase : - attraction based chasing

SoundChase --> CheckSound : A < At
SoundChase -[#4050fbff]-> PlayerChase : <color:#4050fbff>player moving\n<color:#4050fbff>  in FOV

PlayerChase : - target based chasing

PlayerChase -down->  Attack : in attack range
PlayerChase --> Confused : C > Ct
note on link
    C = Confusion function
    Ct = Confusion threshold
end note
PlayerChase --> SoundChase : player not in FOV\n and A < At

Attack : - trying to hit player

Attack --> PlayerChase : attack complete

Confused : - moving towards last confusing sound played

Confused --> SoundChase : A >= At
Confused --> Patrol : check complete
Confused -[#4050fbff]-> PlayerChase : <color:#4050fbff>player moving\n<color:#4050fbff> in FOV

@enduml
